o.gov/content/pkg/FR-1941-07-18/pdf/FR-1941-07-18.pdf\nSHA-256 of the downloaded file: 91902cbf964af743b8bed5bc3ebabec2b821c7ae19b2933f41312a4d452437c0\nLocation: 6 FR 3529, PDF pages 1-1 (confidence high)\nMachine-extracted text layer of the official PDF (OCR for 1936-1994 scans). May contain recognition errors and parts of neighbouring documents on the same pages. Not an authenticated transcription: check the PDF pages.\n\n=== PDF page 1 of 26 ===\n»  M I iT T rO A  \\ V i\nDERALREGISTER\nVOLUM E 6 » * ♦  e j v  \n*  ^ A / I T E O  ^\nNUM BER 139\nWashington, Friday, July 18, 1941\nThe President e x e c u t i v e o r d e r\nA m e n d m e n t of E xecutive  O rder N o.\nCONTENTS  \nTHE PR ESIDENT\nEXECUTIVE ORDER\nReserving  P ublic  L and  for  U se  of  the  \nDepartment  of the  N a v y for  N aval  \nAviation  P urposes\nNEVADA\nBy virtue of the authority vested in me  \nas President of the United States, it is  \nhereby ordered as follows:\n1, The following-described tract of  \nland in the Southwest quarter (SW V i)  \nof section 8, T. 23 S., R. 64 E., M. D. M.,  \nNevada, containing twenty (20) acres,  \nmore or less, at the Boulder City Airport  \nsite, within the Boulder Dam National  \nRecreational Area, is hereby set apart  \nand reserved for use for naval aviation  \npurposes under the jurisdiction of the  \nSecretary of the Navy:\nBeginning at a point in NE%SW% sec. 8  \nfrom which the corner of secs. 5, 6, 7, and 8  \nbears N. 87°23'53\" W., 3943.29 fee","path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/texts/EO_8821.txt","sha256":"4dd329e88e8637af77912ce99dbeb286c1184785b96fa64adda6cb96e4937604","source":{"line":161,"path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/SOURCES.jsonl","record_sha256":"cb0a47cf44a4a4a36e4732f55e76fd97f8be84d2ac265d3cf7848c9669372ccb"}}]}
